        "Content": "Entrance Hall: (c.6.48m × 2.00m) Welcoming hall with timber flooring and staircase to the first floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t(c.5.42m × 3.88m max.) Front reception room with fireplace, timber flooring and double doors to the kitchen/dining room.\r\n\r\nStudy: (c.5.02m × 3.76m) Generous second reception room, currently used as a study and music room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: (c.7.01m × 6.00m)\tFitted cabinetry, central island, Neff cooker, gas hob, extractor fan, three rooflights and double doors to the garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room/Home Gym: (c.5.20m × 3.07m) Versatile ancillary room with external access.\r\n\r\nBoiler room: (c.2.33m × 1.71m)\tSeparate service room.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t—\tLocated off the entrance hall.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Bedroom: (c.6.27m × 5.15m) Spacious bedroom with fitted wardrobes, walk-in wardrobe and en-suite.\r\nWalk-in wardrobe: (c.2.53m × 1.89m) Separate dressing and storage space.\r\nEn-suite: (c.\t2.57m × 1.89m) Tiled shower room with WC and wash-hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (c.4.08m × 3.51m)\tDouble bedroom with fitted storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: (c.4.01m × 3.25m)\tDouble bedroom overlooking the rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: (c.2.46m × 1.80m)\tSmaller room, currently labelled nursery/laundry room on the plan.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: (c.2.63m × 1.89m) Tiled bathroom with bath, WC and wash-hand basin.\r\n\r\nAttic Area: 1\t(c.4.25m × 3.85m) Additional attic space with rooflight and sloping ceilings.\r\n\r\nAttic Area: 2\t(c.4.25m × 3.24m) Additional attic space with sloping ceilings and fitted storage.\r\n\r\nAttic: WC\t1.65m × 1.13m\tSeparate WC off the attic landing.\r\n\r\nAsking €1.25m \r\n\r\nContact - Vinnie Finnegan: 087 231 3345"
