        "Content": "QUIET CUL-DE-SAC SETTING IN AN ESTABLISHED KILLINEY NEIGHBOURHOOD.\r\nAPPROXIMATELY 225. SQ.M., EXCLUDING THE ATTIC SPACE OF APPROX. 38 SQ.MT.\r\nFOUR BEDROOMS, TOGETHER WITH TWO ADDITIONAL ATTIC SPACES.\r\nGENEROUS PRINCIPAL SUITE WITH WALK-IN WARDROBE AND EN-SUITE.\r\nTWO SEPARATE RECEPTION ROOMS.\r\nSPACIOUS KITCHEN/DINING ROOM WITH CENTRAL ISLAND & THREE ROOFLIGHTS.\r\nNEFF COOKER, GAS HOB AND EXTRACTOR FAN.\r\nSEPARATE UTILITY ROOM/HOME GYM.\r\nLANDSCAPED FRONT AND REAR GARDENS.\r\nPAVED DRIVEWAY PROVIDING OFF-STREET PARKING.\r\n16 SOLAR PANELS WITH 10 KWH BATTERY STORAGE.\r\nELECTRIC VEHICLE CHARGING POINT.\r\nCOMPLETELY REFURBISHED RELANDSCAPED IN 2006 2019 RESPECTIVELY.\r\nUNDERFLOOR HEATING IN ENSUITE BATHROOM\r\nGLENAGEARY DART STATION (APPROXIMATELY 14 MINUTES)\r\nDALKEY VILLAGE (APPROXIMATELY  15 MINUTES)\r\nBARNHILL STORES (APPROXIMATELY 7 MINUTES)\r\nKILLINEY NATIONAL SCHOOL (APPROXIMATELY 10 MINUTES)\r\nRATHDOWN SCHOOL (APPROXIMATELY 10 MINUTES)\r\nST JOSEPH OF CLUNY SCHOOL (APPROXIMATELY 10 MINUTES).\r\nFITZPATRICKS' CASTLE HOTEL AND FITNESS CENTRE (APPROXIMATELY 10 MINUTES)"
